{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSDictionary","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDictionary"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tags","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Dictionary of tag names and values to set for the current device","type":"text"}]}],"name":"tags"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags are key-value pairs that enable targeted push notifications based on user attributes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and behavior. Use tags to segment your audience and send personalized messages to specific"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"user groups."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Supported Tag Types","level":2,"anchor":"Supported-Tag-Types"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Type"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"String"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"city\": \"New York\"","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text values"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Integer"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"age\": 25","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Numeric values","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Boolean","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"isPremium\": true"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"True\/false values","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"interests\": [\"sports\", \"music\"]"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrays of strings"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Date"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"lastPurchase\": Date()","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NSDate objects"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Update user profile tags after account changes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class UserProfileManager {","","    func updateUserTags(for user: User) {","        var tags: [String: Any] = [","            \"user_id\": user.id,","            \"email_verified\": user.isEmailVerified,","            \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","            \"signup_date\": user.createdAt,","            \"app_version\": Bundle.main.appVersion","        ]","","        \/\/ Add subscription info if premium","        if let subscription = user.subscription {","            tags[\"subscription_tier\"] = subscription.tier.rawValue","            tags[\"subscription_expiry\"] = subscription.expiryDate","            tags[\"is_premium\"] = true","        } else {","            tags[\"is_premium\"] = false","        }","","        \/\/ Add user preferences","        if !user.interests.isEmpty {","            tags[\"interests\"] = user.interests","        }","","        \/\/ Add location if available","        if let location = user.location {","            tags[\"country\"] = location.country","            tags[\"city\"] = location.city","            tags[\"timezone\"] = location.timezone","        }","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags(tags)","        Logger.debug(\"User tags updated: \\(tags.keys.joined(separator: \", \"))\")","    }","","    func trackPurchase(product: Product, amount: Decimal) {","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"last_purchase_date\": Date(),","            \"last_purchase_amount\": NSDecimalNumber(decimal: amount),","            \"last_purchase_category\": product.category,","            \"total_purchases\": incrementTag(\"total_purchases\")","        ])","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setTags:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"title":"setTags:","roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets user tags for device segmentation.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setTags:":{"title":"setTags:","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"tex